{"steam_appid":1198970,"steam_name":"I Am Jesus Christ","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1198970/1848378037/d00e10592a1afee80383e277eeb779323c851348/1774406000/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1774433809","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257308656/c4272b89487bf00e08666a049c0a59331f8c94e5/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1774433809","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/ss_a912a097c1656a8a0209fc66232d9f8da9c307d9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786657983","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/1921bcdad383cbb41bb42d48c657411392d02be9/ss_1921bcdad383cbb41bb42d48c657411392d02be9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786657983","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/50e28a3d544f1b8d79b0c793bc0a4249cc4cc27c/ss_50e28a3d544f1b8d79b0c793bc0a4249cc4cc27c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786657983","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/2249f80b25630d7c06b44a8eed3bdc1740d72978/ss_2249f80b25630d7c06b44a8eed3bdc1740d72978.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786657983","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/64ee43cafc0355d9ec5d69fb64243b0c3e6cd1f7/ss_64ee43cafc0355d9ec5d69fb64243b0c3e6cd1f7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786657983"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>I Am Jesus Christ</strong> is a first-person narrative experience inspired by the Gospels, letting you witness the life, ministry, and trials of Jesus from a new interactive perspective.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Relive Defining Moments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Experience key events from the life of Jesus and witness moments whose meaning still resonates today.  See these scenes unfold from a personal perspective and engage with the story in a way that feels immediate and immersive.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/168ede8142df254fd2d12770e5c6ff45.poster.avif?t=1786657983\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/168ede8142df254fd2d12770e5c6ff45.webm?t=1786657983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/168ede8142df254fd2d12770e5c6ff45.mp4?t=1786657983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Journey Through the Holy Land</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Travel across diverse locations from Jesus’ ministry, from deserts and mountains to towns brought to life with atmosphere and detail. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/dc58798759fcfa28b3988c3d7f845494.poster.avif?t=1786657983\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/dc58798759fcfa28b3988c3d7f845494.webm?t=1786657983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/dc58798759fcfa28b3988c3d7f845494.mp4?t=1786657983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Discover the Teachings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore the foundations of the Christian faith through an interactive journey inspired by the life and message of Jesus. Gain a deeper sense of the ideas, values, and events that continue to shape millions of lives around the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/48e8c217598bf2e3de2a7f0a21a00771.poster.avif?t=1786657983\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/48e8c217598bf2e3de2a7f0a21a00771.webm?t=1786657983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/48e8c217598bf2e3de2a7f0a21a00771.mp4?t=1786657983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Resist the Tempter</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Stand firm against Satan’s temptations and face the spiritual trials that lead to the fulfillment of Scripture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/71900ffff9fafcd42a77e42fcaeecda2.poster.avif?t=1786657983\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/71900ffff9fafcd42a77e42fcaeecda2.webm?t=1786657983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/71900ffff9fafcd42a77e42fcaeecda2.mp4?t=1786657983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Read the Scriptures</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Encounter selected Bible passages throughout the game and connect each moment of the journey to the words that shaped it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/7f8ef72d855e32ede9aeb78b6a0348f1.poster.avif?t=1786657983\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/7f8ef72d855e32ede9aeb78b6a0348f1.webm?t=1786657983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/7f8ef72d855e32ede9aeb78b6a0348f1.mp4?t=1786657983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Are you ready to resist temptation in the desert, heal the sick, and uplift those in need? Perform over 30 meaningful miracles - from feeding the 5,000 and healing lepers to calming the storm and restoring sight to the blind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> Key Features: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive the life of Jesus Christ from His baptism to the crucifixion and resurrection</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit faithfully recreated locations in the Holy Land, including Jerusalem and Galilee</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform over 30 iconic miracles, such as feeding the 5,000 and walking on water</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be guided by the Holy Spirit and strengthen your spiritual connection through prayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet story-driven characters, including Christ's disciples, and reenact key moments such as the Last Supper</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-7500 / AMD Ryzen 5 1500X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-12100 / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660 SUPER<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","Casual","Indie","Simulation"],"developers":["Space Boat Studios"],"publishers":["PlayWay S.A."],"release_date":"2 Apr, 2026"}